<section class="policy-page"><span class="micro">END CULTURE / LEGAL</span><h1>PRIVACY</h1><div class="policy-copy"><p>END CULTURE is operated by Orion GLE Ltd. We collect and use personal information where necessary to operate this website, process and fulfil orders, take payments, provide customer support, prevent fraud, comply with legal obligations and, where you have chosen to receive them, send marketing and product-release updates.</p><p>Depending on the purpose, we process information because it is necessary to perform our contract with you, comply with a legal obligation, pursue our legitimate business interests, or because you have given consent. We may share information with service providers that help us operate the store, including Shopify, payment providers, delivery carriers and other technology or professional service providers where necessary.</p><p>We keep personal information only for as long as reasonably necessary for the purpose for which it was collected, including legal, accounting, tax, fraud-prevention and dispute requirements. You may have rights over your personal information including access, correction, deletion, restriction, portability and objection, depending on the circumstances. Where processing relies on consent, you can withdraw that consent.</p><p>For privacy enquiries or to exercise your rights, contact <a href="mailto:info@endculture.co.uk">info@endculture.co.uk</a>. You also have the right to complain to the UK Information Commissioner's Office if you are unhappy with how your personal information is handled.</p><p>Our store may use cookies and similar technologies. Where consent is required for non-essential cookies, these should only be used after you have made your choice.</p></div></section>{% schema %}{"name":"Privacy","settings":[]}{% endschema %}